=== cgi-fcgi ===
DESCRIPTION ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Missing application pathname Missing -connect <connName> where <connName> is
either the pathname of a UNIX domain socket or (if -bind is given) a
hostName:portNumber specification or (if -start is given) a :portNumber
specification (uses local host).


USAGE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  cgi-fcgi -f <cmdPath> , or
  cgi-fcgi -connect <connName> <appPath> [<nServers>] , or
  cgi-fcgi -start -connect <connName> <appPath> [<nServers>] , or
  cgi-fcgi -bind -connect <connName> ,


POSITIONALS (2) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  appPath
  nServers


FLAGS (4) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
-f <cmdPath>
    -connect <connName>
    -start
    -bind
